cal information about working\n                     at Cal Maritime, as well as links to numerous services and opportunities. Academic Resources Academic Technology Calendars Campus Policies Diversity at Cal Maritime Employee Resource Center Facilities Management Faculty and Staff Directory Faculty Development Faculty Senate Financial Services Graphic Standards Manual Human Resources - Faculty and Staff Information Technology Library Police Department Procurement Registrar's Office Right to Know Safety & Risk Management Student Financial Services Faculty and Staff Faculty and Staff Overview Academic Resources Faculty Affairs PeopleSoft California State University Maritime Academy Facebook Twitter LinkedIn YouTube Instagram California State University Maritime Academy 200 Maritime Academy Drive Vallejo, CA 94590 707-654-1000 Intranet Canvas PeopleSoft The Passport Email Library Map & Directions Contact Us A-Z Department List Campus Directory Title IX Accessibility Accreditation Emergencies Right to Know © 2024 California State University Maritime Academy. All Rights Reserved. Back to Top ©"
